      "file": "clips/05_storage.wav",
      "canonical_text": "Underneath that continuity is Walrus Protocol: decentralized storage for data. A photograph, a dataset, a website, or an encrypted memory can become a blob. The content lives across storage nodes, off the blockchain.",
